## 4. 目标架构：只保留一条主链

```text
[Workspace upload / directory / Vault / URL / API]
                         │
                         ▼
              CanonicalIntakeService
                         │
              权限确认、流式读取、MIME/格式探测
                         │
                         ▼
                 RawAssetStore
           原件先保存 + SHA-256 + source metadata
                         │
                         ▼
                  Durable Job
       command/idempotency/lease/checkpoint/retry/cancel
                         │
                         ▼
                  FormatRouter
      text | document | OCR | web | audio | video | canvas
                         │
                         ▼
             Local-first Adapter Chain
                         │
                         ▼
                  QualityGate
      ACCEPT | COMPARE | NEEDS_REVIEW | FAILED
                         │
                         ▼
                  ConversionRun
         DerivedDocument + DerivedBlocks + LossReport
                         │
                         ▼
              Anchor + ClaimCandidate
                         │
                         ▼
            VerificationEligibility
        ┌────────────────┼──────────────────┐
        │                │                  │
 public_verifiable  private/nonpublic  opinion/noise
        │                │                  │
        ▼                └──── skip + reason ┘
 Async Public Cross-check
        │
        ▼
 Review Queue → EvidenceBundle
        │
        ├──────── Knowledge → Human Learning
        │
        └──────── AI Asset Candidate → Review → Approved
                         │
                         ▼
          Restart readback / Search / Citation jump / Export
```

### 4.1 强制复用，不得平行重建

- RawAsset：复用 `app.ingestion.raw_asset`，修正合同冲突；
- Conversion：复用 `app.ingestion.conversion_run` 并补版本化锚点；
- Job/Outbox/Receipt：复用 `app.workspace.job_outbox`、worker、dispatcher；
- Research graph：复用 `persist_research_graph` 和既有 Candidate 治理；
- Evidence：复用 Claim/Evidence/EvidenceBundle 合同；
- Knowledge/Learning/AI candidate：复用当前生命周期和人工批准机制；
- Storage：保持 SQLite 单一事实源，不新增第二个“管线状态数据库”；
- UI：复用 Workspace 现有页面，只补最小状态和复核交互，不进行视觉重构。

